   - Trajectory inference: [Slingshot](https://bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc/html/slingshot.html), [Monocle2](https://github.com/mengxu98/monocle), [Monocle3](https://github.com/cole-trapnell-lab/monocle3), developmental direction inference with [VECTOR](https://github.com/jumphone/Vector), and identification of dynamic features.
